Lookahead limiter (src/audio/alimiter.ts)

src/audio/alimiter.ts adapts FFmpeg libavfilter/af_alimiter.c: the AVOption
table (names, defaults and ranges of level_in, level_out, limit, attack,
release, asc, asc_level, level and latency), init (attack and release in
seconds, att = 1), config_input (obuffer_size for buffer, nextdelta and
nextpos, nextpos initialised to -1, buffer_size rounded down to a multiple of
the channel count and the "Attack is too small" refusal), the single packed
dbl format and the per-sample lookahead loop of filter_frame with its att,
delta, nextiter and nextlen state and clamps.

Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
