The TypeScript adaptation implements only asc=0 and latency=0: asc=1 (the
auto-release path and its pow() coefficient) and latency=1 (leading-sample
trimming and padded tail frames) are refused before output. asc_level is
accepted without effect. It accepts only constant decimal values and the
boolean names or 0/1, refuses enable= and has no runtime commands. The
original source and full notices remain in the pinned upstream submodule.
